<view class="page" data-b="B401"><view class="title">发布</view><view class="subtitle">先整理你愿意提供的经验，再选择开放时间。</view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">服务草稿</view><view class="notice">目前保存在这台设备，尚未向其他用户公开，也不会产生订单。</view><text class="field-label">服务名称</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如：网约车入行经验交流" value="{{form.name}}" data-field="name" data-z="Z401-1" bindinput="field" maxlength="40"/><text class="field-label">类别</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{categories}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" data-z="Z401-2" bindchange="category"><view class="picker">{{form.category}}</view></picker><text class="field-label">你能分享什么</text><textarea class="input textarea" placeholder="用几句话说清楚适合谁、能聊什么" value="{{form.description}}" data-field="description" data-z="Z401-3" bindinput="field" maxlength="300"/><view class="fields"><view><text class="field-label">参考价格（元）</text><input class="input" type="digit" placeholder="99" value="{{form.price}}" data-field="price" data-z="Z401-4" bindinput="field"/></view><view><text class="field-label">时长（分钟）</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.duration}}" data-field="duration" data-z="Z401-5" bindinput="field"/></view></view><text class="field-label">交流方式</text><input class="input" value="{{form.mode}}" data-field="mode" data-z="Z401-6" bindinput="field" maxlength="30"/><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" data-b="B402">{{error}}</view><button class="btn save" data-z="Z401-7" bindtap="save">保存为本机草稿</button></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><view><view class="section-title">可关联的开放时间</view><view class="subtitle">来自你的同一张时间表</view></view><text class="link" data-z="Z401-8" bindtap="goSchedule">去设置 ›</text></view><view wx:if="{{openSlots.length === 0}}" class="empty">暂无可用开放时间</view><view wx:for="{{openSlots}}" wx:key="id" class="slot">{{item.label}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">我的草稿</view><view wx:if="{{drafts.length === 0}}" class="empty">还没有草稿</view><view wx:for="{{drafts}}" wx:key="id" class="row draft"><view><view>{{item.name}}</view><view class="small muted">¥{{item.price}} · {{item.duration}} 分钟 · 仅本机</view></view><text class="remove" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-z="Z401-9" bindtap="remove">删除</text></view></view></view>
